msgid ""
"An accessible maths editor: UnicodeMath equations in Markdown, read, navigated and brailled "
"through MathCAT.\n"
"\n"
"Built on MathCAT (DAISY Consortium) and UnicodeMathML (Murray Sargent III), both under the MIT "
"licence. NVDA's symbol dictionaries, downloaded on request, are under NVDA's licence (GPL-2.0).\n"
"\n"
"Mathessible is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later."
msgstr ""
"Editor matematika yang aksesibel: persamaan UnicodeMath dalam Markdown, dibaca, dinavigasi, dan "
"ditampilkan dalam braille melalui MathCAT.\n"
"\n"
"Dibangun di atas MathCAT (DAISY Consortium) dan UnicodeMathML (Murray Sargent III), keduanya "
"berlisensi MIT. Kamus simbol NVDA, yang diunduh bila diminta, berada di bawah lisensi NVDA "
"(GPL-2.0).\n"
"\n"
"Mathessible didistribusikan di bawah GNU General Public License, versi 2 atau yang lebih baru."

